OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment 'determined' to deport
OL,4,Agrooming gang leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government is still considering
OL,7,F"every option" to deport Rochdale
OL,8,Fgrooming gang leader Shabir Ahmed, a
OL,9,FHome Office minister has said, months
OL,10,Fafter ministers suggested emergency
OL,11,Flegislation could be used to remove him
OL,12,Ffrom the UK.
OL,14,FAhmed, 73, was released from prison in
OL,15,FJuly after serving 14 years for rape
OL,16,Fand other sexual offences against
OL,17,Fgirls, some as young as 12.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
