OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment 'determined' to deport
OL,4,Agrooming gang leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said at the time that it
OL,7,Fwould seek to deport Ahmed to Pakistan.
OL,8,FHaving been stripped of his British
OL,9,Fcitizenship, he now holds only
OL,10,FPakistani nationality.
OL,12,FHowever, he remains in the UK because
OL,13,Fexisting legislation prevents the
OL,14,Fdeportation of some Commonwealth
OL,15,Fcitizens.
